 }], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "73deac0c-1bc3-4dbb-a08c-00e82cc6bf48"],
 " are used to calculate ",
 Cell[TextData[{
  Cell[BoxData[
   FormBox[
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
